# Cloudflare Pages redirects (PHI-159). Notes and Log were removed from the
# site; old links and search results land on the home page, not a 404.
# Static rules come before splat rules (Cloudflare: top-most match wins).
# The trailing-slash forms are listed explicitly because Cloudflare does not
# document whether an empty splat (/notes/*) matches /notes/.
/notes    /  301
/notes/   /  301
/log      /  301
/log/     /  301
/notes/*  /  301
/log/*    /  301
